2025-05-19 18:20:14,207 - multilingual_voice_assistant - INFO - Generated response: The SMART Protect Plus Insurance is an investment-linked plan designed for life protection up to age 100 and can be customized to suit your lifestyle and needs. 

[BOLD]Key Benefits[BOLD]: This plan provides a range of benefits including life protection, critical illness coverage, disability benefits, medical cost coverage, accidental death or permanent disablement protection, premium waivers during unexpected times, and income support during disability or cancer. You can tailor the coverage to match your requirements.

[BOLD]Policy Features[BOLD]: You can choose between two coverage types for death benefits. The [BOLD]Increasing Cover[BOLD] pays the Basic Sum Assured plus the Account Value, while the [BOLD]Level Cover[BOLD] pays the higher of the Basic Sum Assured or Account Value (adjusted for withdrawals). The policy automatically extends every 5 years up to age 100 without underwriting, provided the required premium is met. 

[BOLD]Optional Riders[BOLD]: The plan allows you to enhance protection with various riders. Some examples include accidental death benefits, Total Permanent Disability (TPD) lump sum, critical illness coverage, cancer monthly income, and medical benefits such as overseas treatment for selected surgeries and outpatient care for dengue or Zika virus. There are also premium waiver riders in cases of critical illness or disability.

[BOLD]Premium Payment[BOLD]: Premiums are payable throughout the policy term, with flexible payment modes (monthly, quarterly, semi-annually, or annually). Top-up premiums are also available to maximize your account value.

If you'd like more specific details, such as premium amounts, rider terms, or coverage limits, feel free to ask! You might also want to inquire about the differences between the Increasing and Level Cover options or how the auto-extension feature works.
