2025-05-19 22:14:09,383 - multilingual_voice_assistant - INFO - Generated response: We offer a variety of insurance products to suit different needs. Here are some key types:

[HLA Wealth Gain Plus] is a regular premium investment-linked plan. It provides [BOLD]coverage for death only[BOLD] and allows your policy values to grow based on the performance of selected unit funds.

[HLA SMART Wealth Insurance] is an investment-linked plan with [BOLD]coverage up to age 100[BOLD]. It offers protection for death and includes options for top-ups to maximize investment value.

[HLA SMART Protect Plus Insurance] is another investment-linked plan tailored to your lifestyle. It provides [BOLD]life protection up to age 100[BOLD] and offers optional riders for critical illness, disability, medical coverage, and more.

[HLA SMART Saver Plus Insurance] is a [BOLD]non-participating endowment plan[BOLD] with a limited premium payment term of five years. It provides guaranteed cash payments starting from the fifth policy year and coverage for 20 years.

